    "class": "image",
    "note": "output / bloom: max |Δ| ≤ 3/255, mean |Δ| ≤ 0.5/255 (PLAN §5.1 «синтетические входы»); final: the same on ≥ 99 % of the samples (uGrain = 0: hash12 has no sin, but fract() amplifies last-bit multiply-add differences between GPUs, so grain / night chroma noise cannot be bit-identical); pmrem: half-float atlas, |Δ| ≤ 0.02·max(1, |ref|) on ≥ 99 % of the written texels"
  },
  "data": {
    "size": [256, 144],
    "inputs": {
      "hdrRamp": "[x / 128, y / 64, ((x·y) mod 97) / 64]",
