      "ldr": "[⌊255x / (W − 1)⌋ / 256, ⌊255y / (H − 1)⌋ / 256, ((x·y + 7x) mod 256) / 256]",
      "rows": "y = GL row (0 = bottom) of the input DataTexture; output PNGs are stored top row first (pmrem: GL row order, 16-bit samples = half-float bits)"
